Revision history for Docbook-Convert

1.012  2026-09-26

    - Publish public repository metadata through the GitHub mirror.
    - Add contributor and security policies, dependency auditing and
      artifact-attestation verification guidance.
    - Declare the CPAN authority in module and distribution metadata.

1.011  2026-09-26

    - Add the Pandoc conversion pipeline and packaged filters.
    - Preserve section identifiers, includes, admonitions and code examples.
    - Retire direct DocBook-to-POD conversion.
    - Add recursive conversion, stable output and dry-run processing.
    - Prepare the consolidated converter for its first CPAN release.
